[E6 — NEGATIVE CONTROL ★ anti-tautology] no pools (random per-DER schedules):
   acc vs (meaningless) labels = 0.589±0.074 ≈ chance 0.500  -> clustering does NOT manufacture pool structure when none exists. ✓

