HEADLINE (NOT 'signal exists' — that is E1/trivial):
  • co-membership vs function: CO-MEMBERSHIP (E2: real 1.00±0.00 vs func 0.57±0.07 vs chance 0.50)
  • closing defense: pad(constant-cadence+fixed-size) & vpn; jitter/cover/small-batch weak (E3)
